# @manual: primary
REQ-APP-PROCESSING-CUDA-001
doc/01_research/app/REQ-APP-PROCESSING-CUDA-001.md
doc/03_plan/app/REQ-APP-PROCESSING-CUDA-001.md
doc/04_architecture/app/REQ-APP-PROCESSING-CUDA-001.md
doc/05_design/app/REQ-APP-PROCESSING-CUDA-001.md
